---
const steps = [
  {
    label: '1',
    zh: '原始平台文件',
    en: 'Original platform file',
    lostZh: '保留全部元数据：C2PA、XMP、EXIF、PNG 文本块、生成参数',
    lostEn: 'All metadata intact: C2PA, XMP, EXIF, PNG text chunks, generation params',
    intact: true,
  },
  {
    label: '2',
    zh: '聊天 App 转发（微信 / Telegram）',
    en: 'Chat app transfer (WeChat / Telegram)',
    lostZh: '丢失：PNG 文本块、XMP 大部分字段、EXIF GPS 信息',
    lostEn: 'Lost: PNG text chunks, most XMP fields, EXIF GPS data',
    intact: false,
  },
  {
    label: '3',
    zh: '社交平台转码（微博 / Twitter / Instagram）',
    en: 'Social platform transcode (Weibo / Twitter / Instagram)',
    lostZh: '丢失：EXIF 全部字段、C2PA Manifest、XMP CreatorTool、所有生成参数',
    lostEn: 'Lost: All EXIF fields, C2PA Manifest, XMP CreatorTool, all generation params',
    intact: false,
  },
  {
    label: '4',
    zh: '截图或录屏',
    en: 'Screenshot or screen recording',
    lostZh: '丢失：所有原始元数据，仅保留截图软件写入的新 EXIF',
    lostEn: 'Lost: All original metadata; only screenshot tool EXIF remains',
    intact: false,
  },
  {
    label: '5',
    zh: '重新导出 / 另存为',
    en: 'Re-export / save-as',
    lostZh: '丢失：所有溯源字段，可能被新软件写入无关 EXIF',
    lostEn: 'Lost: All provenance fields; new software may write unrelated EXIF',
    intact: false,
  },
];
---

<section class="card content-section evidence-vanish-section" aria-labelledby="evidence-vanish-heading">
  <h2 id="evidence-vanish-heading">
    <span lang="zh-CN">证据为什么会消失？</span>
    <span class="muted" lang="en" aria-hidden="true"> · Why evidence disappears</span>
  </h2>
  <p class="muted" lang="zh-CN">每次转发、压缩、截图，都可能抹去 AI 来源线索。</p>
  <p class="muted" lang="en">Each share, compression, or screenshot may erase AI-origin signals.</p>

  <ol class="vanish-steps" aria-label="传播过程中证据消失的步骤">
    {steps.map((step) => (
      <li class={`vanish-step${step.intact ? ' vanish-step--intact' : ' vanish-step--lost'}`} data-step>
        <div class="vanish-step-header">
          <span class="vanish-step-num" aria-hidden="true">{step.label}</span>
          <span class="vanish-step-title">
            <span lang="zh-CN">{step.zh}</span>
            <span class="vanish-step-en muted" lang="en">{step.en}</span>
          </span>
          <span class={`vanish-badge ${step.intact ? 'vanish-badge--intact' : 'vanish-badge--lost'}`} aria-label={step.intact ? '元数据完整' : '元数据丢失'}>
            {step.intact ? '完整' : '已丢失'}
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="vanish-step-detail muted">
          <span lang="zh-CN">{step.lostZh}</span>
          <span class="vanish-sep" aria-hidden="true"> · </span>
          <span lang="en">{step.lostEn}</span>
        </p>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ol>

  <p class="vanish-emphasis" lang="zh-CN">
    <strong>没有找到证据，不代表它不是 AI。证据可能已经在传播过程中消失。</strong>
  </p>
  <p class="muted vanish-emphasis-en" lang="en">
    No signals found does not mean it is not AI-generated. Evidence may have been erased during sharing.
  </p>
</section>
